# CP-AUTO-005 — MDX + Frontmatter Validator

**Project:** CyberPivot  
**Workstream:** Content Assurance / QA Engine  
**Ticket:** CP-AUTO-005  
**Status:** Implementation specification  
**Depends on:** CP-AUTO-002 Content Rule Inventory, CP-AUTO-003 Rule Classification, CP-AUTO-004 QA Output Contract  
**Next ticket:** CP-AUTO-006 Style Rule Validator

---

## 1. Purpose

Build the first deterministic CyberPivot Content Assurance validator.

The validator will inspect CyberPivot MDX content files and verify:

- file integrity
- MDX/frontmatter parseability
- required frontmatter fields
- valid frontmatter values
- module family metadata
- internal module metadata relationships where they are deterministic

The validator must produce results using the CP-AUTO-004 QA Output Contract.

This ticket deliberately does **not** introduce AI review.

